  "description": "NetMetric.SystemIO.Linux provides Linux-specific implementations of IProcessIoReader and ISystemIoReader for collecting detailed I/O metrics\n\t\t\tfrom the /proc and /sys filesystems. It enables observability of process and device-level read/write statistics using native system data,\n\t\t\tsupporting performance monitoring for .NET applications on Linux.",
